{{!-- primitive-chart — @mantine/charts line/bar chart over a grouped
  projection's LIST response (M-T1.3 Phase 4 pack backfill).

  A chart is an image of data, so the wrapper carries `role="img"` plus the
  walker-derived `aria-label` (mirrors the hand-authored aria-labels on
  primitive-data-grid); the kind discriminator picks the component, and the
  walker's import merge registers only the one that renders. --}}
    <div role="img" aria-label="{{ariaLabel}}"{{{testidAttr}}}>
{{#if isLine}}      <LineChart data={ {{{dataExpr}}} } dataKey="{{dataKey}}" series={[{ name: "{{seriesField}}" }]} h={300} withLegend />
{{else}}      <BarChart data={ {{{dataExpr}}} } dataKey="{{dataKey}}" series={[{ name: "{{seriesField}}" }]} h={300} withLegend />
{{/if}}    </div>
